{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2022-02-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'HOVER AND VERISK TEAM UP TO STREAMLINE PROPERTY CLAIMS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO AND LEHI, UTAH, FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INSURANCE CARRIERS, ADJUSTERS, RESTORERS AND POLICYHOLDERS CAN NOW STREAMLINE CLAIMS ESTIMATING THROUGH AN INTEGRATION BETWEEN VERISK'S XACTIMATE® , THE INDUSTRY-LEADING CLAIMS ESTIMATING SYSTEM, AND HOVER , THE TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT TRANSFORMS SMARTPHONE PHOTOS OF ANY PROPERTY INTO A DIGITAL TWIN WITH VALUABLE 3D DATA FOR INSURANCE PARTNERS. PROPERTY PROFESSIONALS AND POLICYHOLDERS CAN USE THE HOVER APP ON THEIR MOBILE DEVICE TO TAKE A SET OF PHOTOS OF A LOSS SITE."}